==Location and Uses==
Mon is a type of [[Currency]] invented by [[Kilton]] which can be obtained by exchanging Monster Parts with him.<ref name="BotW Kilton" /><ref name="BotW Kilton 2"/> Mon can be used in Kilton's [[Shop]], the [[Fang and Bone]], to buy different types of [[Monster Gear]].<ref name="BotW Kilton 3"/>

